+## Native parametric promotion (review-adf929d968f3fb1a)
+
+A new `workspace/parametric` family preserves the exact two-row-legend rule as
+`mode=canonical` and adds `mode=mapped_region_relay`.  The alternate applies
+the legend, counts the resulting colour-2 regions, and uses that count to
+select one of three payloads.  All scenes retain three raw colour-1 components,
+so the protected raw-source counterfactual selects the wrong payload on the
+30×30 witness.  The first two demonstrations deliberately match on dimensions,
+legend placement, source area, and total occupancy while requiring different
+answers, after an initial adversarial pass exposed nuisance-feature shortcuts.
+Fresh task tests, bounded rival audit, native qualification, public projection,
+and causal replay are retained in the current assignment checks.
+
